questions.q:
On the basis of the following \(E^{\circ}\) values, the strongest oxidizing agent is :-
$\begin{aligned}
& {\left[\mathrm{Fe}(\mathrm{CN})_6\right]^{4-} \rightarrow\left[\mathrm{Fe}(\mathrm{CN})_6\right]^{3-}+e^{-1}, \mathrm{E}^{\circ}=-0.35 \mathrm{~V}} \\
& \mathrm{Fe}^{2+} \rightarrow \mathrm{Fe}^{3+}+e^{-1} ; \quad \mathrm{E}^{\circ}=-0.77 \mathrm{~V}
\end{aligned}\)$

